chapter('Request commissioning and handover records','Completion is more than seeing the system switch on.',[
'Agree which startup, commissioning, inspection and owner-instruction records apply to the selected installation. Ask the responsible qualified provider to identify the checks and documentation appropriate to the equipment and local requirements. This chapter does not provide technical settings or a procedure for performing those checks.',
'Keep the completion report connected to the installed model and serial schedule. Record the date, provider, outcome and any unresolved item. An owner demonstration can confirm that a control function is understood; it does not establish technical performance or replace a required professional check.',
'Ask for an explanation of the report and any follow-up needed under different operating conditions. If a task cannot be completed immediately, record responsibility, timing and how the accepted contract handles that open item. Do not turn an incomplete record into a silent assumption that the work is finished.',
'Save operating manuals, maintenance requirements, warranty terms and service contacts. Distinguish product coverage from labor or workmanship commitments. Confirm any required registration and who performs it, then retain evidence instead of relying only on the longest warranty number in a sales document.'
], 'A fictional handover list has eight required deliverables: six received and two still open. Each open item has a named provider and an agreed date; the count is a tracking aid, not a technical quality score.', [('Agreed deliverables','8'),('Received and recorded','6'),('Open with follow-up','2'),('Technical acceptance','By responsible professionals')],
'Do not convert six out of eight documents into a claim that the installation is 75% technically correct. Resolve the specific open items using the agreed process.',
['Agreed commissioning / inspection / instruction records','Installed models and serials / report references','Open tasks / responsible providers / due dates','Product versus workmanship terms / registration','Operating guidance / maintenance / service contacts'],
['Reports refer to the actual installed equipment.','Open items are explicitly tracked.','Technical acceptance is not replaced by an owner score.'], 'Collect and review the agreed handover file before closing the project record.')

